(7759630, 1284437, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like this gave you a high vote. Its quite compelling. One thing that might potentially bump it up a notch is to clone out the lights in the ceiling just above the roof and in the upper left, but I also get maybe you wanted a very natural look</td>', 'I really like this gave you a high vote. Its quite compelling. One thing that might potentially bump it up a notch is to clone out the lights in the ceiling just above the roof and in the upper left, but I also get maybe you wanted a very natural look', '2023-11-04 09:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
