(7759781, 1284901, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is so amazing.  From your comment I''m hoping you didn''t replace the background with a "texture" . . . It''s gorgeous I love the moment I love the clarity of horse and rider I love the expressions.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This is so amazing.  From your comment I''m hoping you didn''t replace the background with a "texture" . . . It''s gorgeous I love the moment I love the clarity of horse and rider I love the expressions.  Congratulations.', '2023-11-08 00:15:26.000000', NULL, 0),
