(7759787, 1284901, 113411, '<td valign="top">Sorry folks..this is a texture! I''ve been submitting at 1x for a while and this is legal and I honestly forgot.<br/>It had been scoring at 8.4 all week which was a first for me...back to reality!<br/> <br/>ps. The detail is the result of the Nikon mirrorless. I am using the Z7ii and I cannot believe how great it is.<br/>The about to be new Blue is also a Z7ii. I know Sony is the preferred mirrorless and the tracking on Nikon is<br/>lacking but this was shot in very poor light and all around awful conditions and look at the bandaid on the finger.<br/></td>', 'Sorry folks..this is a texture! I''ve been submitting at 1x for a while and this is legal and I honestly forgot.It had been scoring at 8.4 all week which was a first for me...back to reality! ps. The detail is the result of the Nikon mirrorless. I am using the Z7ii and I cannot believe how great it is.The about to be new Blue is also a Z7ii. I know Sony is the preferred mirrorless and the tracking on Nikon islacking but this was shot in very poor light and all around awful conditions and look at the bandaid on the finger.', '2023-11-08 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7759788, 1284850, 113411, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue,<br/> Mary Ann..this is extraordinary and not a texture!!! I should have checked in with you!<br/>xxx</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue, Mary Ann..this is extraordinary and not a texture!!! I should have checked in with you!xxx', '2023-11-08 06:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
